A day in the life.jpg A tongue in cheek meme type image to highlight a future concord type world, where human and AI neighbours casually gripe about daily life.
The Afrikan reference relates to teh current emergent development of Africa whcih will one day become the new technology frotier as per China today. Resulting the same old conplaints about being undercut and laid off.
This is meant to highlight the mundane "life goes on" aspect of the future regardless of technological progress.
